OL,3,AMan admits killing schoolboy in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has admitted killing a
OL,7,F12-year-old boy in a hit-and-run crash
OL,8,Fas he made his way home from school.
OL,10,FLatvian national Dolars Aleksanders was
OL,11,Fextradited to the UK last month,
OL,12,Ffollowing the death of Keaton Slater in
OL,13,FCoventry in 2024.
OL,15,FThe 23-year-old appeared at Warwick
OL,16,FCrown Court via a virtual link from HMP
OL,17,FDovegate on Thursday and only spoke to
OL,18,Fidentity himself and plead guilty to
OL,19,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
