OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is due to be sentenced on 13
OL,7,FNovember. Aleksanders' defence lawyer
OL,8,FDarron Whitehead said no bail
OL,9,Fapplication would be made.
